is introduced to ease the definition of the validation logic for arbitrary classes with several fields. The data can be validated as a Pydantic model or dataclass (or any other type supported by Pydantic), and an instantiation hook is provided to instantiate the arbitrary type.\n\nCo-authored-by: Douwe Maan <hi@douwe.me>", "tree": {"sha": "843ae9909fb21a24b9beb3d599b921d82c7b9c02", "url": "https://api.github.com/repos/pydantic/pydantic/git/trees/843ae9909fb21a24b9beb3d599b921d82c7b9c02"}, "url": "https://api.github.com/repos/pydantic/pydantic/git/commits/ba91a3c9160f3bb8b13e1918a22769b3cbc50c72", "verification": {"payload": "tree 843ae9909fb21a24b9beb3d599b921d82c7b9c02\nparent 27aaf685d9b71ce6f85d72b602b525be4e5b91c2\nauthor Victorien <65306057+Viicos@users.noreply.github.com> 1756325887 +0200\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1756325887 +0000\n\nAdd `ValidateAs` annotation helper (#11942)\n\nA new `ValidateAs` helper is introduced to ease the definition of the validation logic for arbitrary classes with several fields. The data can be validated as a Pydantic model or dataclass (or any other type supported by Pydantic), and an instantiation hook is provided to instantiate the arbitrary type.\n\nCo-authored-by: Douwe Maan <hi@douwe.me>", "reason": "valid", "signature": "-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJor2f/CRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAA+rAQAGNi667dVz4hYXYbD0aj73Nm\na7tqMH5kp6MZGAdkDP+qzNWqbzX/XgxKGF83YUPtUIixmqS+BjZimsJFcPclp9m3\ncyWPPqSBaiIFXMBmM8JVo7qaeW5l/TMOkBs0LoBTjclWJ6IWbwh0vUpg4gUHZmlW\nNhV8PWZl5GIorIyyhPe6fYCUJbmdS5yLPJlh1YfyQgzHnSd5HR5EIy/KO/7PRfM+\nsw9UoTZr72g4Gb2ok34ZbqJXBx/ofrJhEQcsxwhZ+FVKzzUZhPyprsBHzoxq5ds/\nwj3FLsfORaYAyCnpBpZaxtNw3cS7HCVfmUPEcab6sunG5xkVr+6DpI7LZxrehmR3\nG+VkfdMya/TUL2L0V4De+DEyuCMOabRhE/IMYacX0AKyZfc9AeDkoKHG2bfoKxEI\nb1Lic8E2LGYu4LZ2SOL29T/lcQjtWgCXE9SyS0iIMam+cRxHSamydHYyMUJaPK4b\n7qCHE/xT6L9qSM9ZEALePWLYCvQIWmFHp4oE+HD8yHkwzV6QI4CLmosRus5ryvlv\nr2LaV8IM6f9kbViktaNlPqj7/LhzGFwwua6UbxwNbURIJc46snQSNwWFvapr61OE\n0cl0DTOq09S